OL,3,GNEWSAHead teacher defends suspending 25
OL,4,Apupils in one week
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new head teacher has defended
OL,7,Fsuspending 25 pupils in his first week
OL,8,Fafter being criticised by some parents.
OL,10,FDan Jeffries, the new interim principal
OL,11,Fat Frome College in Somerset, said no
OL,12,Fpupil is ever suspended for small
OL,13,Fmatters such as minor dress code issues
OL,14,For lateness.
OL,16,FSome parents have complained on social
OL,17,Fmedia, claiming their children were
OL,18,Fsuspended for actions such as laughing
OL,19,Fin class.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
