OL,3,GNEWSAHead teacher defends suspending 25
OL,4,Apupils in one week
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeffries said he was aware of "online
OL,7,Frumours", adding: "We strongly
OL,8,Fencourage any parent with questions,
OL,9,Fconcerns, or feedback to contact the
OL,10,Fschool directly so we can work together
OL,11,Fconstructively."
